WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.077
Welcome to Future Ready AI.

00:00:02.237 --> 00:00:06.806
I’m your learning guide, and I’m here to help students, educators,

00:00:06.966 --> 00:00:11.119
and school communities understand, create, and lead with artificial intelligence.

00:00:11.279 --> 00:00:13.772
Together, we’ll explore how AI works,

00:00:13.932 --> 00:00:16.008
how to use it responsibly,

00:00:16.168 --> 00:00:21.153
and why human judgment, creativity, and curiosity must always lead the way.

00:00:21.313 --> 00:00:23.805
Whether you are just getting started

00:00:23.965 --> 00:00:26.872
or looking for practical tools and support,

00:00:27.032 --> 00:00:29.109
you’re in the right place.

00:00:29.269 --> 00:00:30.100
Let’s begin.
